# Component design

- Premium enterprise SaaS look: deep navy/slate + teal accent (`#0F766E` family); light cool backgrounds.
- No purple themes, no cream/terracotta defaults, no auto dark mode on this marketing site.
- Use CSS variables from `globals.css`; do not hardcode one-off brand colors in components.
- Typography: Geist; use `.text-display`, `.text-h1`, etc. for hierarchy.
- Cards only when they aid interaction/understanding — not by default in heroes.
- Motion: intentional, 2–3 meaningful motions max per visually led surface; honor reduced motion.
- Keep sections single-purpose; content comes from `@/content` modules.
